    "Fixed authenticated Morph TCP prelude vectors transcribed from Nowhere v3.1.0 src/tests/transport/morph/prelude.rs. They are not generated by the Go encoder.",
    "shared_key_text is the ASCII Shared Key. It is not hex-decoded.",
    "prefix_hex is Prelude[0:32]. high_hex is the 32 tail high bits packed MSB-first into 4 bytes. The codec preserves both.",
